{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22490","headline":"曲江感秋二首 二 · 白居易","name":"曲江感秋二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"疎芜南岸草，萧飒西风树。\n秋到未几时，蝉声又无数。\n莎平绿茸合，莲落青房露。\n今日临望时，往年感秋处。\n池中水依旧，城上山如故。\n独我鬓间毛，昔黑今垂素。\n荣名与壮齿，相避如朝暮。\n时命始欲来，年颜已先去。\n当春不欢乐，临老徒惊误。\n故作咏怀诗，题於曲江路。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22490.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22490","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}